      "content": "it's just like... if i could actually make it so they never had to worry about my moods or my failures ever again. if i could just remove the problem entirely. i want them to be able to live a real life without me always dragging them down. wouldn't that be the most selfless thing i could do for them? to just stop being the thing that's hurting them?",
